{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05797","headline":"送吕向补阙西岳勒碑 · 徐安贞","name":"送吕向补阙西岳勒碑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣作西山颂，君其出使年。\n勒碑悬日月，驱传接云烟。\n寒尽函关路，春归洛水边。\n别离能几许，朝暮玉墀前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐安贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}